            "Note 9 - Balance Sheet Components"
          ],
          "item": "8",
          "text": "(1)In fiscal years 2025 and 2024, we recorded an expense of approximately $2.0 billion and $1.4 billion, respectively, in cost of revenue.\n\n(2)Includes customer advances and unearned revenue related to hardware support, software support, cloud services, and license and development arrangements. The balance as of January 26, 2025 and January 28, 2024 included $81 million and $233 million of customer advances, respectively."
